    <string name="mobile_settings_help">Help</string>
    <string name="mobile_settings_support">Support</string>
    <string name="lemuroid_help_content"><![CDATA[
        <b>&#8226;About Phoenix Down</b><br/>
        This application is a fork of the open source project <b>Lemuroid</b>, distributed under the <b>GPL-3.0</b> license.<br/><br/>
        <b>&#8226;Important Notice</b><br/>
        This application does not include games and does not automatically download any content. The browse feature shows content publicly available on Archive.org. The user is responsible for verifying their rights to access or use any ROM from external sources.<br/><br/>
        <b>&#8226;How do I use this app?</b><br/>
        Copy your ROM files into a directory on your device and select it within the app. This directory can have subdirectories. After the scan completes you should see your games.<br/><br/>
        <b>&#8226;Why aren\'t my games detected?</b><br/>
        If your games are compressed, try uncompressing them. If this doesn\'t work, place ROMs in separate directories, one per system with the following names: $SYSTEMS.<br/><br/>
        <b>&#8226;Licenses</b><br/>
        Lemuroid: GPL-3.0 (Swordfish90)<br/>
        LibretroDroid: GPL-3.0<br/>
        Libretro Cores: Various licenses
    ]]></string>

