    <!-- User Manual -->
    <string name="manual_header">User Manual</string>
    <string name="manual_section_first_steps">🚀 First Steps</string>
    <string name="manual_content_first_steps">1. Select a folder to store your ROMs from Settings → Directory.\n\n2. Copy your ROM files to that folder.\n\n3. The app will automatically scan and display your games on the home screen.</string>
    <string name="manual_section_archive">🌐 Explore Archive.org</string>
    <string name="manual_content_archive">The Catalog section lets you explore ROM collections publicly available on Archive.org.\n\n• Browse by system or search for specific games.\n• Tap on a game to download it to your ROMs folder.\n• Downloaded games will automatically appear in your library.</string>
    <string name="manual_section_controls">🎮 Configure Controllers</string>
    <string name="manual_content_controls">Connect a Bluetooth or USB controller and go to Settings → Controller settings.\n\n• Select your controller from the list.\n• Map buttons according to your preferences.\n• Enable vibration if your controller supports it.</string>
    <string name="manual_section_bios">💾 Required BIOS</string>
    <string name="manual_content_bios">Some systems (PlayStation, Game Boy Advance, etc.) require BIOS files to work.\n\n• Go to Settings → BIOS Information to see what files you need.\n• Place BIOS files in the same folder as your ROMs.\n• The filename must match exactly what is required.</string>
    <string name="manual_section_saves">💾 Saved Games</string>
    <string name="manual_content_saves">Auto-save is enabled by default.\n\n• When exiting a game, your progress is saved automatically.\n• When reopening the game, you will continue where you left off.\n• You can also use the game\'s own save system (in-game menu).</string>
    <string name="manual_section_sync">☁️ Cloud Sync</string>
    <string name="manual_content_sync">You can sync your saved games with Google Drive.\n\n• Go to Settings → Save Sync.\n• Sign in with your Google account.\n• Your saves will automatically sync across devices.</string>
    <string name="manual_section_gameplay">🕹️ During Gameplay</string>
    <string name="manual_content_gameplay">To access the menu during gameplay:\n\n• Press the menu button (☰) or swipe from the screen edge.\n• From there you can: save/load states, change save slot, access quick options, or exit the game.</string>

